Version 1.02 (October 1, 2026)
------------------------------
+ DOCKER_HOST_OPEN_ALL (expert setting, with a warning): allow the containers all services on this host

Version 1.01 (October 1, 2026)
------------------------------
+ DOCKER_HOST_OPEN_TCP/UDP: services (ports) on this host the containers may use

Version 1.00 (October 1, 2026)
------------------------------
+ Initial version: forwarding for the Docker bridges (DOCKER_IF) and to published ports (DNATed
  connections only), warns when Docker's FORWARD policy is DROP
